ry few and easily surmounted) problems.=A0 But the second term, maybe even =
if it can be specified from the first, does create inevitable discontinuiti=
es in a linear structure, and there is no obvious way to bridge those gaps =
but by anaphoric forms of some sort.=A0 As noted, the fact that the structu=
res can be set up to give each term a canonical introduction does simplify =
these repetitions by avoiding needing to refer to buried occurrences in som=
